                    "display_condition": "patient_caregiver",
                    "height": 110.0,
                    "string": "NOTE: A review of your medications was done on {conversation_date} with {patient_caregiver} who served on your behalf. Here is a summary of your medication review.",
                    "string_replacements": {
                        "default": {
                            "Chinese": "\u5099\u8a3b\uff1a\u60a8\u7684\u85e5\u7269\u6e05\u55ae\u548c\u5065 \u5eb7\u72c0\u6cc1\u662f\u5728 {conversation_date}\u8207\u60a8\u7684\u770b \u8b77\u8005{patient_caregiver}\u8a0e\u8ad6 \u7684\u3002 \u8a0e\u8ad6\u5167\u5bb9\u5982\u4e0b\uff1a",
                            "Spanish": "NOTA: Se realiz\u00f3 una revisi\u00f3n de sus medicamentos el {conversation_date} con {patient_caregiver}, su representante. Aqu\u00ed tiene un resumen de su revisi\u00f3n de medicamentos.",
                            "Vietnamese": "<font fontname='Arial-Unicode-normal'>L\u01afU \u00dd: Vi\u1ec7c xem x\u00e9t c\u00e1c lo\u1ea1i thu\u1ed1c c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n v\u00e0o ng\u00e0y {conversation_date} v\u1edbi {patient_caregiver}, ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u1ea1i di\u1ec7n cho b\u1ea1n. D\u01b0\u1edbi \u0111\u00e2y l\u00e0 b\u1ea3n t\u00f3m t\u1eaft c\u1ee7a bu\u1ed5i xem x\u00e9t thu\u1ed1c c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n.</font>"
                        }
