            },
            {
                "paragraph": {
                    "string": "Thank you for talking with me on {conversation_date}, about your health and medications. As a follow-up to our conversation, I have included two documents:",
                    "string_replacements": {
                        "default": {
                            "Chinese": "\u200b\u611f\u8b1d\u60a8\u5728{cmr_date}, \u65e5\u8207\u672c\u4eba\u8a0e\u8ad6\u60a8\u7684\u5065\u5eb7\u548c\u85e5\u7269\u76f8\u95dc\u4e8b\u5b9c\u3002\u70ba\u8ddf\u9032\u6211\u5011\u7684\u8ac7\u8ad6\uff0c\u6211\u5728\u6b64\u9644\u4e0a\u5169\u4efd\u6587\u4ef6\uff1a",
                            "Spanish": "Gracias por hablar conmigo el d\u00eda {cmr_date} acerca de su salud y medicamentos. Para hacer seguimiento a nuestra conversaci\u00f3n, le adjunto dos documentos:",
                            "Vietnamese": "<font fontname='Arial-Unicode-normal'>C\u1ea3m \u01a1n qu\u00fd v\u1ecb v\u00ec \u0111\u00e3 n\u00f3i chuy\u1ec7n v\u1edbi t\u00f4i v\u00e0o {cmr_date}, v\u1ec1 s\u1ee9c kh\u1ecfe v\u00e0 thu\u1ed1c c\u1ee7a qu\u00fd v\u1ecb. \u0110\u1ec3 ti\u1ebfp n\u1ed1i cu\u1ed9c tr\u00f2 chuy\u1ec7n c\u1ee7a ch\u00fang ta, t\u00f4i \u0111\u00e3 g\u1eedi k\u00e8m theo hai t\u00e0i li\u1ec7u: </font>"
                        }
                    },
                    "text_style": {
                        "parent_style": "ParagraphText"
                    }
                }
            },
            {
                "list": {
                    "items": [
                        "Your <b>Recommended To-Do List</b> has steps you should take to get the best results from your medications.",
                        "Your <b>Medication List</b> will help you keep track of your medications and how to take them."
                    ],
                    "items_replacements": {
                        "default": {
                            "Chinese": [
                                "\u60a8\u7684\u5efa\u8b70\u884c\u52d5\u6e05\u55ae\uff0c\u5176\u4e2d\u5217\u51fa\u60a8\u61c9\u8a72\u63a1\u53d6\u54ea\u4e9b\u884c\u52d5\uff0c\u4ee5\u4fbf\u900f\u904e\u60a8\u7684\u85e5\u7269\u5f97\u5230\u6700\u4f73\u6cbb\u7642\u6548\u679c\u3002",
                                "\u60a8\u7684\u85e5\u7269\u6e05\u55ae\uff0c\u9019\u6709\u52a9\u65bc\u8a18\u9304\u60a8\u7684\u85e5\u7269\u548c\u7528\u85e5\u65b9\u5f0f\u3002"
                            ],
                            "Spanish": [
                                "Su <b>Lista de Cosas Para Hacer</b> incluye los pasos que usted debe seguir para obtener los mejores resultados de sus medicamentos.",
                                "Su <b>Lista de Medicamentos</b> le ayudar\u00e1 a monitorear sus medicamentos y saber cu\u00e1ndo y c\u00f3mo tomarlos."
                            ],
                            "Vietnamese": [
                                "<font fontname='Arial-Unicode-normal'>Danh</font> <font fontname='Arial-Bold'>S\u00e1ch Vi\u1ec7c C\u1ea7n L\u00e0m \u0110\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0110\u1ec1 Xu\u1ea5t c\u1ee7a qu\u00fd v\u1ecb</font> <font fontname='Arial-Unicode-normal'>c\u00f3 c\u00e1c b\u01b0\u1edbc m\u00e0 qu\u00fd v\u1ecb n\u00ean th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ea1t \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c k\u1ebft qu\u1ea3 t\u1ed1t nh\u1ea5t t\u1eeb thu\u1ed1c c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh.</font>",
                                "<font fontname='Arial-Unicode-normal'>Danh</font> <font fontname='Arial-Bold'>S\u00e1ch Thu\u1ed1c c\u1ee7a qu\u00fd v</font> <font fontname='Arial-Unicode-normal'>\u1ecb s\u1ebd gi\u00fap qu\u00fd v\u1ecb theo d\u00f5i c\u00e1c lo\u1ea1i thu\u1ed1c c\u1ee7a qu\u00fd v\u1ecb v\u00e0 c\u00e1ch d\u00f9ng thu\u1ed1c.</font>"
                            ]
                        }
