            {
                "paragraph": {
                    "string": "I look forward to working with you and your doctors to make sure your medications work well for you.",
                    "string_replacements": {
                        "default": {
                            "Chinese": "\u6211\u975e\u5e38\u671f\u5f85\u80fd\u8207\u60a8\u548c\u60a8\u7684\u91ab\u751f\u5408\u4f5c\uff0c\u4ee5\u78ba\u4fdd\u60a8\u7684\u85e5\u7269\u5c0d\u60a8\u6709\u529f\u6548\u3002",
                            "Spanish": "Espero poder trabajar con usted y sus doctores para asegurarnos que sus medicamentos son efectivos.",
                            "Vietnamese": "<font fontname='Arial-Unicode-normal'>T\u00f4i r\u1ea5t mong \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m vi\u1ec7c v\u1edbi qu\u00fd v\u1ecb v\u00e0 b\u00e1c s\u0129 c\u1ee7a qu\u00fd v\u1ecb \u0111\u1ec3 b\u1ea3o \u0111\u1ea3m thu\u1ed1c c\u1ee7a qu\u00fd v\u1ecb c\u00f3 hi\u1ec7u nghi\u1ec7m.</font>"
